      {
        "id": "0c160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Thank you for working with us. Before you go, we would like to learn from your time here. Taking part is your choice, and nothing you say will affect your reference or anything else about your leaving.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0c160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "How we use your answers: HR keeps this questionnaire separately from your personnel file. We report what leavers tell us only in summaries that do not name anyone, to improve working life here. We share your own comments with your manager only if you agree at the end of this form.",
